Platforms human review checkpoints
title end

paragraph start
A person reads every AI output about platform rules or account access before it is used and checks any rule against the platform official page. An output without a source is not used.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Nothing is published or changed on an account by a tool without a person approving it first.
paragraph end
